WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.550
A prism repeats its cross-section.

2
00:00:03.252 --> 00:00:07.577
The triangle end is half of four by three: six square centimetres.

3
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.680
Each layer adds another six.

4
00:00:18.576 --> 00:00:21.726
Six times five: thirty cubic centimetres.
